            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><img class=\"imgcenter\" src=\"\" id=\"imgWest\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgWest', '0%')\"/><b>Figure 2</b>: Mercator projection. © Mapswire (<i><htcite0></i>). Shared under the <a href=\"https://whc.unesco.org/en/licenses/6\" target=\"_blank\">Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 IGO</a> license.</p>",
               "source": [
